{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42599","headline":"过衡山赠廖处士 · 张观","name":"过衡山赠廖处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未向漆园爲傲吏，定应明代作徵君。\n传家奕世无金玉，乐道经年有典坟。\n带雨小舟横别涧，隔花幽犬吠深云。\n到头终爲苍生起，休恋耕烟楚水濆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张观","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42599.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42599","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}